---
import MainLayout from '../../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import ContactCTA from '../../components/ContactCTA.astro';

const title = 'Rooter Service in Mason City, IA | A-1 Drain Cleaning';
const description = 'Rooter service in Mason City, Iowa for clogged drains, main drain blockages, sewer-line stoppages and recurring backups. A-1 Drain Cleaning: 641-530-2728.';
---

<MainLayout title={title} description={description} path="/services/mason-city-rooter-service/">
  <Header />
  <main id="main">
    <section class="bg-[#1A1A68] py-14 text-white sm:py-20 lg:py-24">
      <div class="container">
        <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-300">
          <a href="/" class="hover:text-white">Home</a><span class="mx-2" aria-hidden="true">/</span>
          <a href="/services/" class="hover:text-white">Services</a><span class="mx-2" aria-hidden="true">/</span>
          <span class="text-white">Rooter Service</span>
        </nav>
        <p class="mt-6 text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-red-300">Mason City, Iowa</p>
        <h1 class="mt-3 max-w-4xl text-5xl font-black leading-[.98] tracking-tight sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl">Rooter Service in Mason City, IA</h1>
        <p class="mt-6 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-8 text-slate-200 sm:text-xl">A stopped drain is not always just a sink or toilet problem. Rooter service is used when a blockage is in the drain line itself and needs to be mechanically cleared. A-1 Drain Cleaning handles household drain and sewer stoppages in Mason City.</p>
        <a href="tel:+16415302728" class="call-button mt-8 inline-block rounded-md bg-[#c52b34] px-7 py-4 text-center text-lg font-black text-white shadow-lg hover:bg-[#a82129]">CALL 641-530-2728</a>
        <p class="mt-5 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-300">24/7 service • Mason City • Drain and sewer line cleaning</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="bg-white py-14 sm:py-18">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="max-w-4xl">
          <p class="text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#b4232b]">When rooter service makes sense</p>
          <h2 class="mt-2 text-4xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-950 sm:text-5xl">Look at the pattern, not just the fixture</h2>
          <p class="mt-5 text-lg leading-8 text-slate-700">A single slow sink can be a local fixture restriction. When a toilet, tub, floor drain, or several sinks begin acting up together, the restriction may be farther down a shared drain or main line. A rooter machine is used to mechanically open the line when access and conditions call for it.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-10 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
          <article class="border border-slate-200 p-6"><h3 class="text-2xl font-black">Several drains back up</h3><p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-700">Multiple fixtures affected at once can indicate a shared branch or main drain restriction. Tell us which fixtures are involved and what happens when water is used.</p></article>
          <article class="border border-slate-200 p-6"><h3 class="text-2xl font-black">The main drain is stopped</h3><p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-700">A basement floor drain, tub, or shower may become the place where wastewater appears when a downstream line cannot carry the flow away.</p></article>
          <article class="border border-slate-200 p-6"><h3 class="text-2xl font-black">The clog keeps returning</h3><p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-700">A recurring stoppage can have a deeper cause such as roots, buildup, or a damaged section of pipe. Clearing the blockage does not necessarily remove the reason it keeps coming back.</p></article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="bg-slate-100 py-14 sm:py-18">
      <div class="container grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1.2fr_.8fr] lg:items-start">
        <div>
          <p class="text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#b4232b]">What to do before service</p>
          <h2 class="mt-2 text-4xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-950 sm:text-5xl">If wastewater is already backing up</h2>
          <ul class="mt-6 space-y-4 text-lg leading-8 text-slate-700">
            <li><strong>Limit water use.</strong> Do not keep flushing or running fixtures to see if the line clears.</li>
            <li><strong>Stop the washing machine.</strong> A large discharge can push more water into an already restricted line.</li>
            <li><strong>Do not pour chemical drain opener into a backed-up main line.</strong> It can leave hazardous chemical water in the system.</li>
            <li><strong>Tell us the sequence.</strong> Which fixture backed up first? Did another fixture rise when the toilet flushed or washer drained?</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <aside class="border border-slate-300 bg-white p-7">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-slate-950">Related A-1 services</h2>
          <nav class="mt-5 grid gap-3" aria-label="Related services">
            <a class="font-black text-[#b4232b] underline" href="/service-area/mason-city/">Drain Cleaning in Mason City</a>
            <a class="font-black text-[#b4232b] underline" href="/services/main-drain-cleaning/">Main Drain Cleaning</a>
            <a class="font-black text-[#b4232b] underline" href="/services/sewer-line-cleaning/">Sewer Line Cleaning</a>
            <a class="font-black text-[#b4232b] underline" href="/services/tree-roots-in-sewer-line/">Tree Roots in Sewer Lines</a>
            <a class="font-black text-[#b4232b] underline" href="/services/sewer-backup-emergency/">Sewer Backup Emergency Service</a>
            <a class="font-black text-[#b4232b] underline" href="/drain-problem-quiz/">Drain Problem Quiz</a>
          </nav>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="bg-white py-14 sm:py-18">
      <div class="container max-w-4xl">
        <p class="text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#b4232b]">Rooter service questions</p>
        <div class="mt-7 divide-y divide-slate-200 border-y border-slate-200">
          <details class="py-5"><summary class="cursor-pointer text-xl font-black">Is rooter service the same as drain cleaning?</summary><p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-700">Rooter service is a form of mechanical drain-line cleaning. The terms are often used interchangeably, but the important distinction is where the blockage is and what equipment is appropriate for the line.</p></details>
          <details class="py-5"><summary class="cursor-pointer text-xl font-black">Why does my floor drain back up when the washer runs?</summary><p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-700">The washer discharges a large amount of water quickly. A restriction downstream can prevent that flow from leaving normally, causing water to rise at a lower opening such as a floor drain.</p></details>
          <details class="py-5"><summary class="cursor-pointer text-xl font-black">What if the drain keeps clogging after it is cleared?</summary><p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-700">Recurring stoppages deserve attention beyond the immediate clog. Roots, heavy buildup, pipe damage, or another restriction can allow the same line to plug again.</p></details>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="bg-[#1A1A68] py-14 text-white sm:py-18">
      <div class="container text-center"><h2 class="text-4xl font-black sm:text-5xl">Mason City rooter service when the line is stopped</h2><p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-8 text-slate-200">Call A-1 Drain Cleaning at 641-530-2728 for drain and sewer stoppages. Describe what is backing up and which fixtures are affected.</p><a href="tel:+16415302728" class="mt-7 inline-block rounded-md bg-[#c52b34] px-8 py-4 text-lg font-black text-white">CALL A-1: 641-530-2728</a></div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <ContactCTA />
  <Footer />
</MainLayout>
